abstract: >-
  A Germany-focused, evidence-based and falsifiable policy model linking
  security, diplomacy, energy, migration, social policy and infrastructure.
  The model tests a strategy based on credible defence, European strategic
  agency, active German mediation within European diplomacy, verifiable
  de-escalation, conditional economic normalisation, energy diversification,
  labour-market integration and an evidence-based escalation-risk framework.
